`trainer/` is deliberately excluded from the learner ZIP (ADR 0004) — that is a
didactic decision, not a licence restriction. Trainers are welcome to this
material.

It contains no solutions. Those live in the private `werkbank-loesungen`
repository (CLAUDE.md rule 6).
